    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Valarie J. McCall Valarie J. McCall Valarie J. McCall learned to meet leadership demands at an early age. Her first job at a McDonald’s restaurant – and a commute completely reliant on public transportation – began to open her eyes to the injustices and areas for opportunity in her hometown. She learned the value of servant leadership, humility and relationship building, all hallmarks of her leadership style today. Her understanding of these important values helped her begin a public service career as a social worker and eventually as a world leader..."
    ]
  },
